<title>FINLAND: TABLE-TAMROCK H1 PROFIT UP 18 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-TAMROCK H1 PROFIT UP 18 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997</p>
<p>	 (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     110 vs    93</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.51 vs  0.37</p>
<p> Net sales					  2,500 vs 2,344</p>
<p> Operating profit				   135 vs   122</p>
<p> Depreciation					  99 vs  79</p>
<p> Net financial items			charge 25 vs  29 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			  gain 75 vs  14 gain</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  185 vs 107</p>
<p> Taxes						   30 vs  32</p>
<p> Minorities				    charge 1 vs  17 charge</p>
<p> Net profit					   159 vs  59</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    22.1 vs  18.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Tamrock Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
